  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It looks like a common iron weight and is heavy to carry.",
        "chapters": [
          443
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is rank four.",
        "chapters": [
          442
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is an expendable Gu. After primeval essence is poured in, it floats above the user’s head, sheds light over the body, and engraves strength path Dao marks; when spent, it breaks into pieces.",
        "chapters": [
          454
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_dao_marks"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Each copy raises strength by ten jun. One jun is thirty jin, so ten jun is three hundred jin.",
        "chapters": [
          442
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The rank four Gu is weaker than rank four beast strength Gu, but the strength can be stacked until the body reaches its limit. Beast strength Gu of the same kind does not stack that way without other tools.",
        "chapters": [
          443
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_beast_strength_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While using his third copy, Fang Yuan’s body strength sits at twenty jun, six hundred jin.",
        "chapters": [
          443
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After that third use he hits a bottleneck at his body’s limit; he must strengthen skeleton, skin, and tendons before he can hold more.",
        "chapters": [
          454
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the five he bought, three are used and two remain; those three uses raised his strength by thirty jun and reached his body’s limit.",
        "chapters": [
          459
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
